      <title>卷到天际！阿里开源4800亿参数编程模型，Kimi K2直呼“鸭梨山大”？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/4800kimi-k2-20250723081005285-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 08:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
